From 243e90c5739baa05ac10a93d73ad19b63f3b7ac8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Deophius <NO1zhuce@163.com>
Date: Mon, 4 Aug 2025 21:22:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/16] Add pte_index sequence to int and prove its injectivity

(over sequences with the same length)
---
 lock-protocol/src/mm/page_table/mod.rs | 84 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 84 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lock-protocol/src/mm/page_table/mod.rs b/lock-protocol/src/mm/page_table/mod.rs
index f96f704f3..e2aa459fa 100644
--- a/lock-protocol/src/mm/page_table/mod.rs
